OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome early
OL,6,Fevening brightness but gradually
OL,7,Fturning unsettled with an area of
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy rain reaching from
OL,9,Fthe west by late evening, spreading
OL,10,Feast to all parts overnight. Westerly
OL,11,Fwinds backing southerly overnight and
OL,12,Foccasionally freshening around the
OL,13,Fcoasts.
OL,14,
OL,15,CSaturday:FRather cloudy to start with
OL,16,Fsome rain, turning progressively more
OL,17,Fpatchy through the morning, with some
OL,18,Fbrighter spells developing. Variable
OL,19,Fcloud, bright spells and light showers
OL,20,Fin the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
