OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAfter
OL,6,Fovernight fog clears Sunday mainly dry
OL,7,Fwith light winds and sunny spells,
OL,8,Fbest in east. Monday wet and
OL,9,Foccasionally windy with the east in
OL,10,Fbest of shelter. Tuesday showery.
